{'symbol': 'CCL', 'date': '2022-11-22 03:06:00', 'title': '2022 TAINAN FOOD, WINE AND WHISKEY CARNIVAL ATTRACTS OVER 60,000 VISITORS', 'text': 'TAINAN, TAIWAN--( BUSINESS WIRE )--THE “2022 TAINAN INTERNATIONAL FOOD AND WINE CARNIVAL” STAGED OVER TWO DAYS FROM OCT. 29-30 AT THE SPRING (河樂廣場) IN TAINAN ATTRACTED MORE THAN 60,000 VISITORS, A THREE-FOLD INCREASE FROM THE PREVIOUS EDITION.'}